@scene awakening

background: night_forest.avif
music: awakening.mp3

dialogue:
"Darkness."
"..."
"You slowly open your eyes."
"A cold wind brushes against your face."
"Wet grass beneath your hands. The smell of earth and pine."
"Above you, through black branches, hang stars in shapes you do not recognise."

background: night_valley.avif

dialogue:
"You sit up."
"The trees fall away below you into a valley you have never seen."
"Mountains stand black against a sky the colour of deep water."
"A thin crescent moon rests above them — too small, and the wrong shape."
"You don't remember how you got here."
"You don't remember anything before this moment."

background: ruins.png

dialogue:
"You turn."
"Behind you, half-swallowed by the hillside, stand ancient ruins."
"Broken columns. Stone worn smooth by centuries of weather."
"Something deep inside them is still faintly glowing."
"Suddenly..."

system arrival:
"ISEKAI ARRIVAL"
"You have been summoned to another world."

system alarm:
"SYSTEM INITIALIZING"
"Welcome, Unknown Traveler."
"Identity required."

npc System:
"Please initialize your character."

mission:
variables_intro

reward:
xp: 25
title: Awakened One

next:
chapter_1_dragon
